            <div xml:id="d290">

                <pb facs="0289" n="173" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg173"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/635.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Vice Consul at Foochow to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Foochow</hi></placeName>, ([<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1911-11-07T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1911-11-01T00:00:00+08:00">undated</date>;] <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received November 7, 1911.</hi>)</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The right of asylum may be requested by the mandarins. Instructions
                    requested.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Thompson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
